Subject: [PATCH] ndppd: use a portable unsigned integer type

The non-standard uint typedef is unavailable with musl.

--- a/src/ndppd.h
+++ b/src/ndppd.h
@@ -149,7 +149,7 @@
     char name[IF_NAMESIZE];
     nd_lladdr_t lladdr;
 
-    uint index;
+    unsigned int index;
 
     nd_proxy_t *proxy;
 
